{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16858","headline":"九日陪刘中丞宴昌乐寺送梁廷评 · 朱放","name":"九日陪刘中丞宴昌乐寺送梁廷评","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独坐三台妙，重阳百越间。\n水心观远俗，霜气入秋山。\n不弃遗簪旧，宁辞落帽还。\n仍闻西上客，咫尺谒天颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱放","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16858.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16858","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}